### EcoCycle Collector Module - Local API Testing with REST Client
### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@authToken = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:5000/

### 2. Register Collector Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Afia Jabin",
  "email": "afiajabin12@gmail.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "collector",
  "phone": "+880 1712-345678",
  "district": "Dhaka",
  "assignedDistricts": ["Dhaka", "Gazipur"],
  "vehicleType": "Electric Waste Van (EV-04)",
  "vehicleNumber": "Dhaka Metro-DH-11-2045"
}

### 3. Login Collector (Auto-saves token for subsequent requests)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "afiajabin12@gmail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 4. Get Current User Profile (Me)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 5. Get Collector Dashboard Statistics (KPIs)
GET {{baseUrl}}/collector/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 6. Get All District Pickup Requests
GET {{baseUrl}}/collector/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7. Filter Requests by Status (Pending)
GET {{baseUrl}}/collector/requests?status=Pending
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 8. Filter Requests by District (Dhaka)
GET {{baseUrl}}/collector/requests?district=Dhaka
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 9. Get Single Request by Custom ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/collector/requests/REQ-BD-8903
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 10. Step 1: Accept Pickup Request
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/collector/requests/REQ-BD-8903/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 11. Step 2: Mark Request Collected with Verified Weight (e.g. 15.5 kg)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/collector/requests/REQ-BD-8903/collect
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "verifiedKg": 15.5
}

### 12. Get All Authorized Recycling Facilities
# @name getFacilities
GET {{baseUrl}}/facilities

### 13. Step 3: Deliver to Facility (Replace with valid facility ID from Step 12)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/collector/requests/REQ-BD-8903/deliver
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "facilityId": "66ce00000000000000000001"
}

### 14. Step 4: Mark Request as Completed
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/collector/requests/REQ-BD-8903/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
